{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120551","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120551/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120551/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120551/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120551","id":4718346328,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7pQehk","number":120551,"title":"Fix dangling pointer crash in SkeletonModificationStack2D during scene reload","user":{"login":"gebojiang","id":250485739,"node_id":"U_kgDODu4b6w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250485739?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang","html_url":"https://github.com/gebojiang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-06-22T15:58:06Z","updated_at":"2026-06-29T15:54:16Z","closed_at":"2026-06-29T15:49:17Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120551","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120551","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120551.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120551.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #120552\r\n\r\n**Problem:**\r\nThe engine experiences a critical crash (segmentation fault / read access violation) caused by a dangling pointer in `SkeletonModificationStack2D`. The Modification Stack Resource holds a raw pointer (`Skeleton2D *`) to its skeleton. When the `Skeleton2D` node is freed (e.g., during scene reloading, node deletion, or editor manipulation), this pointer is not automatically cleared, leading to a hard crash when the engine attempts to dereference it later.\r\n\r\n**Solution:**\r\nInstead of heavily refactoring the reference system or adding execution-time validation checks, this PR addresses the root cause directly at the point of destruction with a minimal 3-line fix:\r\n* Added cleanup logic inside the `Skeleton2D::~Skeleton2D()` destructor.\r\n* Before the skeleton is completely removed from memory, it now actively notifies the modification stack to nullify the pointer by calling `modification_stack->set_skeleton(nullptr)`.\r\n\r\nThis destructor callback ensures that the modification stack never holds a dangling pointer, safely resolving the crash at the exact moment the node is destroyed.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n**Notes on this approach:**\r\nMy previous attempt at fixing this issue involved a much larger refactor and runtime state validation (checking the pointer before execution). This revised version is a much lighter and more elegant solution. By utilizing a standard destructor cleanup pattern, it entirely avoids adding any lookup or validation overhead inside the `_execute()` loop.\r\n\r\n**Tests conducted:**\r\n* Validated that the engine no longer crashes during scene reloading or node deletion in the editor.\r\n* Confirmed that `SkeletonModificationStack2D` safely handles the skeleton's destruction without causing memory access violations.","closed_by":{"login":"gebojiang","id":250485739,"node_id":"U_kgDODu4b6w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250485739?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang","html_url":"https://github.com/gebojiang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gebojiang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120551/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120551/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}